# Keep top-level project README and data dictionary
!README.md
!DATA.md

# --- Reproducibility artifacts intentionally tracked despite the broad ignores
#     above (SLURM job scripts, train/val/test splits, normalisation stats,
#     per-experiment READMEs, curated result files). These are force-added with
#     `git add -f`; the data itself (imagery, masks, checkpoints, logs) stays
#     ignored. Run `git ls-files` to see exactly what is published.

